<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - National Media rating cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - National Media rating cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc said Friday it lowered its rating on National Media Corp to market performer from buy focus as a result of weaker-than-expected Q3 results and doubts over management's ability to isolate the problems to the quarter.</p>
<p>--Analyst George Sutton also cut estimates on the direct marketing services provider to $0.41 from $0.81 for FY97 and to $0.60 from $1.10 for FY98.</p>
<p>--National Media closed at 5-3/4, off 1-5/8, in trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
